The original logo of PARI/GP, Logo_PARI-GP_Couleurs.svg, was drawn in 2012
by Sylvain Glaviano and is copyright Université de Bordeaux.

The modifications to obtain Logo_PariDroid.svg were made by Andreas Enge
in 2015 and are put into the public domain. The logo is a combination of
the original PARI/GP logo and the text "Droid" in the free font Droid Sans.
